The redextape mini-language toolchain

Usage: redextape [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  fmt   Format source files in place
  lint  Report parse, type and lint diagnostics
  run   Run a program and print its value
  emit  Compile a program to a backend text form
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --config <PATH>  Read settings from this file instead of searching for one. Naming a file that does not exist is an error, where finding no file during the search is not
      --no-config      Ignore any `redextape.toml` and use built-in defaults
  -h, --help           Print help
  -V, --version        Print version
